        "Ensure generated Rust code follows systems programming best practices",
        "Perform standard self-check: Load all Rust and systems programming references",
        "Follow ex:DecisionLoggingPattern for implementation decisions",
        "When asking user questions, follow ex:UserQuestionHandling"
      ],
      "aalangKnowledge": [
